# A static field that some access may meet before its definition has run stays a property read by name and may be undefined. The loss belongs to that field: the fields beside it stay variables
# The class objects that escape are handed to native code, which only reads them. One call of a callee nobody knows in the program would let code that nobody compiles write to them, and then nobody knows the writers of their static fields
